# An .aiignore file follows the same syntax as a .gitignore file.
# .gitignore documentation: https://git-scm.com/docs/gitignore
# JetBrains AI Assistant, Junie, Cursor, and Claude Code automatically respect the project's .gitignore in any location,
# and also the system's global .gitignore file that may be specified in the `core.excludesfile` config parameter.
# Only add any extra files that should be ignored by AI systems. You cannot, however, unblock files that are git-ignored.

# Do not include content that is already included in AGENTS.md
.ai/guidelines
resources/ai/guidelines.md
